### ============================================
### 테이블오더 API 테스트 모음
### 기준: BE 실제 구현 (2026-04-08 최신)
### 사용법: VS Code REST Client 확장 또는 IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@adminToken = {{login_admin.response.body.token}}
@tableToken = {{login_table.response.body.token}}

### ============================================
### 0. 헬스체크
### ============================================

### 서버 상태 확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================
### 1. AUTH — 인증
### ============================================

### 1-1. 관리자 로그인
# @name login_admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "STORE01",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 1-2. 테이블 디바이스 로그인
# @name login_table
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/table/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "STORE01",
  "tableNumber": 1,
  "tablePassword": "0000"
}

### 1-3. [실패] 잘못된 비밀번호로 관리자 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "STORE01",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 1-4. [실패] 잘못된 매장 코드로 테이블 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/table/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "INVALID",
  "tableNumber": 1,
  "tablePassword": "0000"
}

### ============================================
### 2. CATEGORY — 카테고리
### ============================================

### 2-1. 카테고리 목록 조회 (공개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 2-2. 카테고리 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "디저트",
  "displayOrder": 4
}

### 2-3. 카테고리 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "메인요리",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 2-4. 카테고리 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================
### 3. MENU — 메뉴
### ============================================

### 3-1. 메뉴 목록 조회 (전체, 공개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus

### 3-2. 메뉴 목록 조회 (카테고리별, 공개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus?categoryId=1

### 3-3. 메뉴 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "비빔밥",
  "price": 8500,
  "description": "야채 비빔밥",
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "displayOrder": 3
}

### 3-4. 메뉴 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menus/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김치찌개 (매운맛)",
  "price": 9500,
  "description": "진한 김치찌개",
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 3-5. 메뉴 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menus/7
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3-6. 메뉴 순서 변경
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menus/order
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "menuId": 1, "displayOrder": 2 },
  { "menuId": 2, "displayOrder": 1 }
]

### 3-7. [실패] 존재하지 않는 카테고리로 메뉴 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트",
  "price": 1000,
  "description": "",
  "imageUrl": null,
  "categoryId": 999,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### ============================================
### 4. TABLE — 테이블
### ============================================

### 4-1. 테이블 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4-2. 테이블 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": 4,
  "name": "테이블 4",
  "password": "0000"
}

### 4-3. 테이블 정보 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tables/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "VIP 테이블",
  "password": "1234"
}

### ============================================
### 5. ORDER — 주문
### ============================================

### 5-1. 주문 생성
# @name create_order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 5-2. 테이블별 주문 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tableId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5-3. 주문 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5-4. 주문 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5-5. 관리자 대시보드 (테이블별 주문 현황)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5-6. 주문 이력 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/history?tableId=1&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5-7. [실패] 빈 주문 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": 1,
  "items": []
}

### 5-8. [실패] 존재하지 않는 테이블로 주문
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": 999,
  "items": [
    { "menuId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### ============================================
### 6. RECOMMENDATION — 추천
### ============================================

### 6-1. 인구통계 데이터 저장 (주문 완료 후)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/demographic
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "gender": "MALE",
  "ageGroup": "TWENTIES"
}

### 6-2. 추천 메뉴 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?gender=MALE&ageGroup=TWENTIES
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}

### 6-3. 추천 메뉴 조회 (데이터 부족 시)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?gender=FEMALE&ageGroup=TEENS
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}

### ============================================
### 7. RATING — 별점
### ============================================

### 7-1. 별점 등록 (주문 완료 후)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "ratings": [
    { "menuId": 1, "score": 5 },
    { "menuId": 3, "score": 4 }
  ]
}

### 7-2. 전체 메뉴 평균 별점 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/ratings/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{tableToken}}

